<title>USA: Security Associates buys New Jersey firm.</title>
<headline>Security Associates buys New Jersey firm.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Associates International Inc said it acquired Northern Central Station Inc, an alarm monitoring company based in Little Falls, N.J.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to add about $225,000 of earnings before income tax, depreciation and ammortization and about $40,000 in monthly revenue, Security Associates said.</p>
<p>Security Associates shares were down 5/64 at 3-9/64 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
